sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant M as Manager (SPA)
  participant A as Django API
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant R as Redis
  participant T as notify task
  participant G as SSE gateway
  participant E as Employee (SPA)
  M->>A: POST /leave/{id}/approve
  A->>DB: update leave + commit
  A--)R: on_commit: enqueue notify(event_id)
  A-->>M: 200
  R--)T: deliver (at-least-once)
  T->>DB: INSERT notifications ON CONFLICT (event_id, user_id) DO NOTHING
  T--)R: PUBLISH user:{id} {unread}
  R--)G: message
  G-->>E: SSE event: unread=3
  T--)R: enqueue send_email(event_id, user_id)
